{
  "name": "bg-profile-sync",
  "displayName": "Background Profile Sync",
  "description": "让 shalldie.background 的背景图跟随 VS Code 配置文件(profile)自动切换。",
  "publisher": "local",
  "version": "2.1.1",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/linpigeon/vscode-bg-profile-sync.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/linpigeon/vscode-bg-profile-sync#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/linpigeon/vscode-bg-profile-sync/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "vscode",
    "vscode-extension",
    "background",
    "background-image",
    "profile",
    "profiles"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.80.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./extension.js",
  "extensionKind": [
    "ui"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "bgProfileSync.syncNow",
        "title": "立即同步背景",
        "category": "Background Profile Sync"
      },
      {
        "command": "bgProfileSync.diagnose",
        "title": "诊断：打印当前同步状态",
        "category": "Background Profile Sync"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Background Profile Sync",
      "properties": {
        "bgProfileSync.enabled": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "窗口启动时检查安装目录里注入的背景是否与当前配置文件的 `background.*` 配置一致，不一致就自动重写（必要时自动重载窗口一次）。"
        },
        "bgProfileSync.emptyBehavior": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "clear",
            "keep"
          ],
          "default": "clear",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "当前配置文件没有配置任何背景图时，清掉背景（推荐）。",
            "当前配置文件没有配置背景图时，保持现有背景不变。"
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "当前配置文件没有配置背景图时的行为。"
        },
        "bgProfileSync.syncMode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "loader",
            "html"
          ],
          "default": "loader",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "注入一个稳定加载器，背景 CSS 由扩展写到安装目录的 JSON 里，加载器定时读取（约 120ms 生效）。换配置文件/改配置都不需要重载窗口。",
            "旧行为：直接把配置写进 workbench.html，改完需要重载窗口一次。配了 background.editor 或 loader 失效时用它兜底。"
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "背景同步方式。`loader` = 零重载（推荐），`html` = 旧行为（每次改配置重载一次）。"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
